     "payload": "tree 57c53c7a3e6dc34100fd6fcc8e4322c45ce6ca2b\nparent 601492157a7e563b5cd4cdea8c9382302a1ea5f4\nauthor Aashish Kumar <aaskumar@confluent.io> 1793269888 +0530\ncommitter Aashish Kumar <aaskumar@confluent.io> 1793269888 +0530\n\nMINOR: validate partition in DefaultForeignResponseSinkPartitioner\n\nDefaultForeignResponseSinkPartitioner routes foreign-key join responses to the\npartition stored in the subscription record, without checking it against the\nnumber of partitions. A negative value makes the ProducerRecord constructor\nthrow and fails the task, and a value that is too large fails the send.\n\nFall back to the default partitioner, as for subscriptions without a\npartition, when the partition is outside [0, numPartitions), and log a warning.\n\nAdded unit tests in KTableImplTest and KTableKTableForeignKeyJoinScenarioTest.\n",
